  "raw": {
    "https://www.epfl.ch/about/working/faculty-position-in-bioengineering-technologies/": {
      "title": "Faculty Position in Bioengineering Technologies",
      "description": "Faculty Position in Bioengineering Technologies ‒ Working at EPFL ‐ EPFL Skip to content About Education Research Innovation Schools Campus Search on the site Validate Show / hide the search form Search on the site Hide the search form EN FR EN DE IT Menu … Afficher l'intégralité du fil d'Ariane About Affiche les pages de même niveau About Education Research Innovation Schools Campus Laboratories list Working at EPFL Affiche les pages de même niveau Organization and identity Associated campuses Data Presidency Vice Presidencies Working at EPFL Recruiting talent from EPFL Equality, Diversity, Inclusion Respect Sustainability News & Media Philanthropy EPFL Alumni Contact Faculty Welcome Affiche les pages de même niveau Job opportunities Employment conditions Faculty Welcome Apprenticeships at EPFL Civilian Service Open Faculty Positions Affiche les pages de même niveau Rules and Regulations For Faculty Members Open Faculty Positions Welcome & Onboarding CEAE – EPFL Committee of Academic Evaluation Visiting Professors and Academic Visitors Women Professors Forum Inside Faculty Affairs Contacts Faculty Position in Bioengineering Technologies Affiche les pages de même niveau Faculty Position in Bioengineering Technologies Faculty Position in Women’s Health Engineering and Digital Technologies Faculty Position in Computational Modeling in Chemistry or Chemical Engineering Faculty Position in Experimental Particle Physics Faculty Positions in Finance Faculty Position in Mathematics of Learning Faculty Position in Theory and Simulation of Materials Faculty Position in Tribology and Interface Engineering Faculty Position in Energy Systems Faculty Positions in Computer & Communication Sciences – Security and Privacy Faculty Positions in Computer & Communication Sciences Faculty position in Structural Engineering and Mechanics Faculty Position in Ethics of Technology Faculty Position in Urban Design and Landscape About Education Research Innovation Schools Campus In the same section Faculty Position in Bioengineering Technologies Faculty Position in Women’s Health Engineering and Digital Technologies Faculty Position in Computational Modeling in Chemistry or Chemical Engineering Faculty Position in Experimental Particle Physics Faculty Positions in Finance Faculty Position in Mathematics of Learning Faculty Position in Theory and Simulation of Materials Faculty Position in Tribology and Interface Engineering Faculty Position in Energy Systems Faculty Positions in Computer & Communication Sciences – Security and Privacy Faculty Positions in Computer & Communication Sciences Faculty position in Structural Engineering and Mechanics Faculty Position in Ethics of Technology Faculty Position in Urban Design and Landscape Faculty Position in Bioengineering Technologies The School of Engineering at EPFL invites applications for a faculty position in Bioengineering Technologies. Appointments will be at the Tenure Track Assistant Professor level. We seek exceptional individuals who will develop and lead a research program at the forefront of the discipline and who will have a strong commitment to excellence in undergraduate and graduate-level teaching. We look for innovative individuals to develop next generation measurement technologies in the broad field of bioengineering and/or biomedical engineering, with a strong focus on tool development, devices and instrumentation. Approaches include, but are not limited to: bio-imaging/bio-microscopy, biophysics, single molecule tracking and force spectroscopy, micro/nanofluidics, electron microscopy, scanning probe microscopy, biosensors and bioelectronics, biomedical devices, bioengineering lab automation. Thematic links to research topics at the Institute of Bioengineering, or wherever relevant at the School of Engineering, School of Life Sciences and School of Basic Science, are strongly encouraged. The candidate’s ability to teach STEM subjects and/or bioengineering topics will be a key selection criterion. EPFL offers world-class research infrastructures and core facilities. Its environment is multilingual and multicultural. Switzerland has an exceptionally high human development index and consistently ranks highly in quality of life, economic competitiveness, and innovation. The application package should include the following documents in pdf format: cover letter, a curriculum vitae including a publication list, a synopsis of major accomplishments, and a concise statement of future research agenda and teaching interests, along with the names and contact information of three to five references who are ready to supply a letter upon request. Application deadline: October 1st, 2026 . Applications should be uploaded to the EPFL recruitment page: https://facultyrecruiting.epfl.ch/position/65044484 Inquiries can be addressed to: Prof. Georg Fantner Chairman of the Search Committee E-mail : [email protected] Further information about EPFL and our School is available at epfl.ch , sti.epfl.ch and bioengineering.epfl.ch EPFL is an equal opportunity employer and family friendly university. It is committed to increasing the diversity of its faculty. It strongly encourages women to apply. About Organization and identity Associated Campuses Data Presidency Vice Presidencies Working at EPFL Recruiting EPFL Talents Equality, Diversity, Inclusion Respect Sustainability News & Media Philanthropy EPFL Alumni Education Admission Academic Calendar Preparatory Year (CMS) Bachelor Master Doctorate SHS Program Continuing Education - Extension School Study Management International Teaching Educational Initiatives Education & Science Outreach Infrastructures Under Development Engaging with Society Research Mission and Policy Research Domains EPFL Research Facilities Faculty Members Solutions 4 Sustainability - S4S Awards and Prizes Funding Opportunities Research Management Support From Lab to Market Research Ethics Research with Animals Open Science Innovation Industry Collaboration Innovation Initiatives Startup Launchpad Campus Services & Resources Library Restaurants, Shops & Hotels Security, Prevention & Health Sports Community & Support Chaplaincy Events Arts & Culture Associations Visit EPFL Mobility & Travel Schools & Colleges School of Architecture, Civil & Environmental Engineering ENAC School of Basic Sciences SB School of Engineering STI School of Computer & Communication Sciences IC School of Life Sciences SV College of Management of Technology CDM Practical Services & Resources Emergencies: +41 21 693 3000 Contact Map Follow EPFL on social media Follow us on Facebook Follow us on Instagram Follow us on LinkedIn Follow us on Mastodon Follow us on X Follow us on Youtube Accessibility Disclaimer Privacy policy © 2025 EPFL, all rights reserved Back to top"
